OL,4,CBad Girls star Helen Fraser dies aged  
OL,5,C84                                     
OL,6,GBritish television, theatre and film   
OL,7,Gstar Helen Fraser, who was perhaps     
OL,8,Gbest known for her role in the hit     
OL,9,Gprison drama Bad Girls, has died.      
OL,11,FThe actress, who also appeared in      
OL,12,Fepisodes of Coronation Street and The  
OL,13,FRoyle Family, reportedly died on 10    
OL,14,FNovember at Yaxley House Care Home, in 
OL,15,FEye, Suffolk. She was 84.              
OL,17,FBorn in Oldham, Greater Manchester,    
OL,18,Fshe had lived in Wickham Skeith, in    
OL,19,FSuffolk, with her late husband Peter   
OL,20,FHandford.                              
